    "name": "Tugas Tiap Menit",
    "description": "Pengganti setInterval sweep unpaid->expired, catchUpNotifications & listener Realtime approve/reject. Klaim notifikasi atomik sebelum kirim. JANGAN publish selama bot lama masih jalan di DB yang sama (notifikasi dobel).",
    "active": false,
    "isArchived": false,
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "e102c6c6-b4c3-4fa6-a58f-2e77884a8522",
        "name": "Tiap Menit",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
        "typeVersion": 1.4,
        "position": [
          0,
          0
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "rule": {
            "interval": [
              {
                "field": "minutes",
                "minutesInterval": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "be4c5421-0473-486e-9d40-8d6d8e01be43",
        "name": "Kedaluwarsakan DP & Bersihkan State",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
        "typeVersion": 2.7,
        "position": [
          224,
          0
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "operation": "executeQuery",
          "query": "with dp_kedaluwarsa as (\n  update public.whatsapp_requests set payment_status = 'expired'\n   where payment_status = 'unpaid' and payment_expires_at < now()\n  returning id\n), dedup_lama as (\n  delete from bot.processed_messages where received_at < now() - interval '1 day'\n  returning 1\n), percakapan_lama as (\n  delete from bot.conversations where updated_at < now() - interval '24 hours'\n  returning 1\n)\nselect (select count(*) from dp_kedaluwarsa) as dp_kedaluwarsa,\n  (select count(*) from dedup_lama) as dedup_dihapus,\n  (select count(*) from percakapan_lama) as percakapan_dihapus"
        },
        "credentials": {
          "postgres": {
            "id": "bzISw2QfqVYUFsSu",
            "name": "Postgres account"
          }
        },
        "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
      },
      {
        "id": "5ce627e9-dbeb-48db-a141-59e2224db7a2",
        "name": "Klaim Notifikasi Status",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
        "typeVersion": 2.7,
        "position": [
          448,
          0
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "operation": "executeQuery",
          "query": "-- Ditandai terkirim SEBELUM mengirim: eksekusi tiap menit bisa tumpang tindih,\n-- dan klaim ini mencegah satu notifikasi terkirim dua kali. Gagal kirim = klaim dibatalkan.\nupdate public.whatsapp_requests r\n   set status_notified = true\n where r.id in (\n   select id from public.whatsapp_requests\n    where status in ('approved', 'rejected') and not status_notified\n    order by received_at\n    limit 20\n    for update skip locked\n )\nreturning r.id, r.status, r.sender_wa_id, r.sender_phone, r.sender_name,\n  r.extracted_day, r.extracted_time, r.extracted_service,\n  (select shop_name from public.business_hours limit 1) as shop_name"
        },
        "credentials": {
          "postgres": {
            "id": "bzISw2QfqVYUFsSu",
            "name": "Postgres account"
          }
        },
        "executeOnce": true
      },
      {
        "id": "e60e1965-4104-4baa-b42d-297a5e1c8a3e",
        "name": "Susun Notifikasi",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [
          672,
          0
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "// Port notifyStatusChange() di server/index.js. sender_wa_id (ID chat asli)\n// diprioritaskan karena rekonstruksi dari sender_phone bisa gagal untuk sebagian kontak.\nreturn $input.all().flatMap(({ json: row }) => {\n  if (!row.id || (!row.sender_wa_id && !row.sender_phone)) return [];\n  const [servis, barber] = (row.extracted_service || '').split('|BARBER:');\n  const namaText = row.sender_name ? ` ${row.sender_name}` : '';\n  const text = row.status === 'approved'\n    ? `Halo Kak${namaText}, booking untuk ${row.extracted_day} jam ${row.extracted_time} (${servis}${barber ? `, kapster ${barber}` : ''}) sudah dikonfirmasi. Kami tunggu kedatangannya di ${row.shop_name || 'BarberFlow'}.`\n    : `Mohon maaf, Kak${namaText}, slot ${row.extracted_day} jam ${row.extracted_time} ternyata tidak tersedia. Silakan hubungi kami kembali apabila ingin mencari jadwal lain.`;\n  return [{ json: { id: row.id, chatId: row.sender_wa_id || `${row.sender_phone}@c.us`, text } }];\n});\n"
        }
      },
